2024-01-01 open Assets:A
2024-01-01 open Assets:B

; Assets:A is 1 + 1e-30 (31 significant digits). rust_decimal rounds it to
; exactly 1, so a rust_decimal-only check would see 1 + (-1) = 0 and report the
; transaction as balanced. Beancount (arbitrary precision) keeps the 1e-30 and
; flags an imbalance; the decimal_exact side channel lets us match that.
2024-01-02 * "over-precise residual"
  Assets:A   1.000000000000000000000000000001 USD
  Assets:B  -1 USD
